WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Meet Ninja Master Magnum

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:42.050
The car can't go any further.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:43.740
Get out.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.100
Sheesh.  We have to walk?

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:50.420
The finals will be at that stadium.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.220
Let's hurry.  Duelists other than Kaiba may already be there.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:00.030
He's building a city for amusement around the stadium.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.970
Kaiba Corporation loves to do big things.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:08.910
But unfinished buildings makes me feel like I'm in an eerie ghost town.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.340
How did you make the finals when you're such a coward?

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:15.100
Whatever!

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.350
By the way, Mai...

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.020
I always wanted to ask you something.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.650
During Duelist Kingdom, why did you...

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.860
Stand up, Jonouchi!

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:30.390
Save your tears of frustration after you lose a duel!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.330
It's a runny nose, not tears!

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.340
It's not stopping.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.020
Here.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:40.120
Wipe your nose.  You look pathetic.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.180
Jonouchi, don't abandon your wishes so quickly.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:50.050
Those tears for your sister - or was it a runny nose?  Well, that's irrelevant.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:53.250
I hope your wish comes true.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.360
This is...

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.590
Why did you...

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.980
Give you the card?

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.030
I'll tell you.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:09.240
Because we're friends.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.520
So cool!

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.200
Hey, Jonouchi!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.970
It's Jean-Claude Magnum's ninja movie!

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:18.540
I hope it's out soon!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.580
I'm a huge fan!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.800
Sheesh!  He wasn't listening to me!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.400
What?

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.150
Hey!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.570
That was dangerous!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.560
This isn't a film shoot!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:48.060
Sorry, boy.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.050
Jean-Claude Magnum!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.140
In the flesh!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.860
Hello!  How do you do?

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:11.520
Me is you's very very fan!

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.730
It's been awhile, Mai.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:22.010
I've come for you, as promised.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.940
What?  You're mistaking me for someone else.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.950
Wow, Mai!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.720
You know a Hollywood star?

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.780
He has the wrong person.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:33.750
No!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.960
Mai, did you forget our promise?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.140
Promise?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.790
Yes.  Our promise.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.770
Attack Mr. Magnum directly!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:52.870
Whip Punish!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.700
I have 0 life points.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.540
Even a Hollywood star is nothing in a duel.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.410
Oh?

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:06.350
Are you going to avenge this duel by using your ninja skills?

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:13.460
Mai Kujaku, your strength has captured my heart.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.030
Marry me.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.910
Mai?

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.900
Tell that joke after you win our duel.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:27.370
If I win, you'll agree to marry me?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.280
You won't defeat me in a million years.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:35.410
Don't forget!  It's a promise!

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.550
I sorta remember now...

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.090
I'll defeat you today and take you home to Hollywood.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.360
That's not for you to decide!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.100
What are you talking about, Mai?

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:54.100
A Hollywood star is proposing to you!  You're incredible!

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:56.110
You can't refuse!

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.930
Don't duel!  Get married!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.710
Why do you want me to marry him?

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:06.880
Because it'll be cool if my friend is married to a Hollywood star!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.320
Sheesh!  He's such a kid!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.320
Fine.  I'll duel you.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.990
So you'll marry me if I win the duel.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.380
You think you'll win?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.130
Mai...

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:25.180
Shouldn't you be focused on the finals?

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:28.700
Only the first 8 duelists can enter the tournament.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:34.070
But I don't think he'll let us through unless she agrees to duel.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:35.870
That's true.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.680
She'll be fine.  Mai will defeat him quickly.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.610
Yeah!  Good luck, Mai!

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:46.580
I thought you wanted me to lose.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.520
Well, uhh...

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.800
Let him borrow your Duel Disk.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.420
No problem.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.590
A Duel Disk!

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:03.830
Only ranked duelists can have one.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.960
I'm a ranked duelist.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.110
And I've collected five Puzzle Cards.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:17.030
If Mai loses, she can't enter the finals!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:21.450
I don't want entry into the finals.  I want you.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:26.880
Mai has already qualified, so she doesn't have to wager her Puzzle Cards.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.890
That's right, Mai.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:35.830
No.  I want to show him that things don't always go as he planned.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.240
Let's start the duel!

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:53.950
My turn.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:59.620
I summon Ninja Commander Ikusa in attack position.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.660
A Ninja monster?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.600
Art of Duplication!

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:12.700
What?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.540
There's another ninja!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.600
When Ninja Commander is in attack position...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:24.980
...I can Special Summon a Ninja Soldier from my hand in attack position.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:33.000
A Hollywood star shouldn't be proud for summoning two lame low-Level monsters.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:33.720
Lame?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.310
Here I go!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:38.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.600
Go, Amazoness Swords Woman!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.770
Amazoness Slash!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.510
Jean-Claude Magnum is really weak!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.750
He's no star.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:03.390
C'mon!  Don't destroy my image of a ninja hero!

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:08.320
Impressive, Mai.  You're more powerful than before.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:11.160
My turn.  I draw a card.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.920
Ninja Commander Ikusa in attack position.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:25.170
I Special Summon Ninja Soldier Katana!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.610
Just like your acting, your dueling is repetitive.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.770
You're harsh as always.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.550
But I love that about you.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:38.970
Brother, isn't Mai wonderful?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.490
She's gorgeous and cool!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.430
Really?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.300
I never thought about that.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.910
Do you think she has a boyfriend?

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.130
Of course not!

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.630
She's only interested in dueling.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:56.070
Besides, what guy can deal with her personality?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.860
That idiot!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.080
What's wrong?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.910
Mai, it's your turn.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.350
You don't have to tell me!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.920
Get him, Amazoness Swords Woman!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.650
Amazoness Slash!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.700
Mai, I was waiting for this moment.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:17.280
What do you mean?

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.850
My turn.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:26.480
Ninja Commander and Ninja Soldier must be in the graveyard to summon Ninja Master Shogun.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:32.010
I tribute Ninja Soldier Katana to summon Ninja Master Shogun!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.510
Ninja Master Shogun!

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:50.790
Does it have an effect?

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.660
I'll show it to you.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:11:00.230
Ninja Master can Special Summon a Commando and Soldier from my deck in attack position.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:12.300
When Ninja Commando Kabuki is summoned in attack position...

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:20.420
...it Special Summons a Ninja Girl in attack position.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.460
Brother, is Mai okay?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:29.630
Don't worry.  Mai is a first-class duelist.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.630
She can easily deal with that monster.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:35.160
I got you!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:39.430
Ninja Master Shogun attacks Amazoness Swords Woman!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.830
Art of Fire!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:50.450
Ninjas, attack Mai directly because she has no monsters to defend with!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:57.560
Mai!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.760
What am I doing?

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.000
I have to focus!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:06.000
Mai, don't be mad at me.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:10.710
I don't want to hurt the one I love, but love is a battle.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:14.180
Please understand the passion in my heart!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:17.140
Heh.  I just let my guard down.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.550
What's wrong?  You don't make mistakes like this!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:25.420
At this rate, Mai may really have to marry him!

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:44.070
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.270
My turn!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.270
C'mon, focus.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:51.000
I can't let this duel stop me from the finals!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.930
I summon Cyber Harpie!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:03.820
In order to defeat a group of enemies, I have to aim for their boss!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.660
Harpie Lady, Scratch Crush!

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.060
I activate my trap!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.800
Ninja Smoke Ball!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.920
The trap card Ninja Smoke Ball!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:23.880
It ends your attack this turn.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.670
That card isn't fair!

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.710
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:32.750
I draw a card.

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:38.310
I'm hearing our wedding march, Mai.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:42.440
No, you're hearing your funeral march!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.960
Your insults are also attractive.

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:48.200
But this seals my victory.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:54.460
The Equip Spell Great Kite of Ninja!

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:04.190
Only a Ninja Master can use Great Kite of Ninja.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:08.620
No spells or monster attacks can reach him!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.930
No way!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:20.170
And even if you have a monster to defend with, I can tribute one monster to let it attack you directly!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.040
I tribute Ninja Soldier Katana!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.460
Attack Mai directly!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.330
Art of Thunder!

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:34.780
My turn ends.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:38.600
Let's stop this pointless duel and discuss our honeymoon.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:41.490
The duel isn't over yet!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:45.930
At this rate, Mai will be his bride!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:48.160
That card isn't fair!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.310
Yugi, can she do something?

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:55.870
Yeah.  If she can draw Harpie's Feather Duster, she may have a chance.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:01.020
Mai!  Do you have Harpie's Feather Duster in your hand?

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.400
I would've already used it if I did!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.820
Use your pushy attitude to draw it!

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.370
Sheesh...

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.570
My turn!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.660
Well?  Did you draw Harpie's Feather Duster?

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.370
Looks like she didn't!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.400
Is there another way, Yugi?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.060
She shouldn't focus too much on Ninja Master.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:31.010
Ninja Master can't attack from his kite unless he has a monster to tribute.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.110
That's right!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.680
Mai!  Stay calm!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.480
You calm down!

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:44.420
Listen!  Ninja Master can't attack from his kite unless he has a monster to tribute!

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:47.320
Hey!  This is an official duel!

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.710
You can't give advice!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.300
But he still has three Ninjas!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.500
And Mai only has one monster.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.980
Mai is still at a disadvantage.

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.600
If nothing changes...

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.900
Do whatever you can, Mai!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:05.800
You can't waste time here!

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.010
What about the finals?

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.220
I know!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:12.320
Your friends are here for you!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.650
Friends...

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:22.160
The spell card Elegant Egotist!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.520
This card multiplies Harpie Lady!

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.000
Scratch Crush!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.070
All right!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.870
Goddamn kid!

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.060
"Kid?"  Are you talking about me?

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:50.560
Yes.  A kid like you isn't worthy of an adult woman like Mai.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.990
Stay out of a romance between grownups!

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:58.420
What?  I have every right to date Mai!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:04.620
Just an example.

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:08.620
I'm a Hollywood star with money and fame.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.080
You're just a student.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.110
It's clear who's more qualified.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.310
You're so arrogant!

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.080
You think you're Hollywood?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.780
You're only in B movies that have never been nominated for an Academy Award!

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:26.120
But you said you're his fan a minute ago.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.800
That was a minute ago.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:34.800
Anyway, it's all over when I summon a monster to tribute next turn.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:38.660
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.530
My turn.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:41.870
Good!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.850
Now Ninja Master can attack Mai directly!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:56.120
Mai!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.420
I activate the spell card Grave Arm!

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.190
What?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.200
You no longer have a monster to tribute.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.500
It's my turn.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.170
You're a defenseless star.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.800
Ninja Master may appear perfect, but it has a weak point.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:25.960
It can't be attacked when it's flying in the sky on its kite.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.980
But that means it can't defend you either!

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:35.650
In other words, you have no monsters to protect you.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.100
Harpie Ladies, attack him directly!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.300
Triple Scratch Crusher!

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.170
Oh no!  Mai!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.620
Game over, Hollywood star.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.300
Real life doesn't always have happy endings.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.810
What's so funny?

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:04.260
Maybe the shock of losing made him insane.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:09.530
At the end of a drama, there's always a surprising twist.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:13.880
Don't be dumb!  You have no life points left-

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:15.970
That's...

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.680
What's going on?

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:20.350
The duel's over, so why didn't it vanish?

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:22.570
That's not Solid Vision!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.370
It's real!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.620
Yes!  Hollywood special effects!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.710
Let me go, cheater!

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:39.080
Since I didn't win the duel, I'm taking her by force.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.240
Hey!  Wait!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.020
Brother!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:51.000
Bring Mai quickly!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.850
Wait!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:56.750
Let me go!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.970
Let me go now!

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.180
Mai!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.000
Oh!  Mai!

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.550
Stuntman, save Mai!

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:13.360
What are you doing?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:16.770
Mai!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.360
Jump, Mai!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.490
Jonouchi!  But...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.030
Don't worry!  I'll catch you!

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.010
Are you okay, Jonouchi?

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:35.100
Mai!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.680
I'm glad you're safe.  Let's go.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.020
You can't do anything without a stuntman!

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:45.600
But my love is real.

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:49.060
If you love someone, save her personally!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:53.510
This kid looks more like a hero than you.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.200
I lose.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.660
Brother!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:03.370
You okay?

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.860
You're really refusing fame and riches?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.550
There are other men who want a wonderful woman like me.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:13.330
True.  Some men have strange tastes.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.200
Idiot!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.570
Ouch...

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:18.150
Are you okay?

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.420
I'm fine.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:26.340
Let's hurry!  The venue for the finals is right there!

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.040
Yeah!

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.880
We arrive at a stadium that's under construction.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:45.320
Is this really the venue for the finals?

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:48.800
But entrants arrive one after another.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.200
Even Namu and Bakura!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:54.400
And Marik finally shows himself.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:58.600
A giant airship descends from above us.

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:02.490
What?  The real duel arena is this airship?

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:05.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Battle Ship Takes Off!

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:07.220
Duel, standby!

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:26.330
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:31.710
I feel like I've been here

00:22:32.230 --> 00:22:41.360
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:52.870
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:55.760 --> 00:23:00.400
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:05.670
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:10.750
Will never change

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:16.050
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:21.250
To be who I am

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:26.490
I've kept searching for something

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:31.170
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:34.130
I learned that's the answer

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:41.240
From now until forever...
